 "coverageStatement": "Verifies consistency between bytes and manifest, not truth: the hashes come from the manifest, so editing both together stays self-consistent. Says nothing about whether sections are correct or the text complete -- that needs a reader. The orphan listing is bounded by the same four globs the sweep uses, so a stray file of another shape is invisible to both.",
